  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hi there, thank you for showing interest in joining us at Mod Heaven as an affiliate. We created Mod Heaven because we are car enthusiasts ourselves, always playing around with our cars and modifying and upgrading them as much as we can. We wanted to create a store where rev heads like us can get quality and cool car modification parts, custom auto lighting, performance upgrades, and auto accessories at affordable prices with free shipping on all orders.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our products are targeted and tailored to car modification enthusiasts, catering for the Euro, JDM, Australian, and other modification styles. As an affiliate, you will earn a 10% commission on the total order value, with our orders usually being well over $100 due to our free shipping discount and the nature of the products we sell. We are also happy and open to discussing bonuses and higher commission rates for those bringing in a good number of refferals.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payments to you will be made via PayPal or direct bank transfer to the bank of your choice on the last business day of the month. We look forward to working with you!</p></div>",
